  "technical_note": "The opening bass moves for three beats, then settles into a two-beat chord. Bars 5\u20136 reverse that balance: chord first, moving notes afterwards. Leave the two beats of shared silence in bar 4 intact. Voice the highest note of the final four-note RH chord without forcing its ninth.",
